  "body": "Adds a second status note to the top of README.md, under the existing \"pre-1.0, for testing\" banner: CamCraft is an experimental work in progress, under heavy and fast-moving development, so every posted program should be treated as a first draft - simulated, dry-run with the spindle off and Z raised, a hand on the feed hold. It carries a light-hearted nod to the famous line *\"Some of you may die, but it's a sacrifice I am willing to make\"* and asks readers to report anything odd as an issue.\n\nDocs only; nothing built or run.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
